[{"answer":"Hi, Laura - could you spare a few minutes to talk about the work placement you did last summer?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm thinking of doing one myself...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi, Tim. Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Didn't you do yours at an environmental services company?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/4.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/5.mp3"},{"answer":"It's only a very small company","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/6.mp3"},{"answer":"and they needed someone to produce a company brochure,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/7.mp3"},{"answer":"and I wanted to get some business experience","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/8.mp3"},{"answer":"because I'm interested in a career in occupational psychology in a business environment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/9.mp3"},{"answer":"It was good because I had overall responsibility for the project.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/10.mp3"},{"answer":"What kind of skills do you think you developed on the placement?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, apart from the ones you already had...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you have to do all the artwork for the brochure, the layout and everything?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/13.mp3"},{"answer":"We hired the services of a professional photographer for that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I did have to use my IT skills to a certain extent","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/15.mp3"},{"answer":"because I cut and pasted text from marketing leaflets,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/16.mp3"},{"answer":"but that didn't involve anything I hadn't done before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you think you got any better at managing your time and prioritizing things?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/18.mp3"},{"answer":"You always used to say you had trouble with that...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, definitely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/20.mp3"},{"answer":"There was so much pressure to meet the project deadline.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/21.mp3"},{"answer":"And I also got better at explaining things and asserting my opinions,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/22.mp3"},{"answer":"because I had to have weekly consultations with the marketing manager and give him a progress report.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/23.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounds as if you got a lot out of it then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/25.mp3"},{"answer":"It was really worthwhile...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/26.mp3"},{"answer":"But you know, the company benefited too...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, they must have done.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/28.mp3"},{"answer":"After all, if they'd used a professional advertising agency to produce their brochure instead of doing it in-house,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/29.mp3"},{"answer":"presumably they'd have paid a lot more?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I worked it out -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/32.mp3"},{"answer":"it would have been 250% more.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/33.mp3"},{"answer":"And I thought the end result was good,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/34.mp3"},{"answer":"even though we did everything on site.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/35.mp3"},{"answer":"The company has quite a powerful computer","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/36.mp3"},{"answer":"and I managed to borrow some scanning software from the university.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/37.mp3"},{"answer":"The new brochure looks really professional;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/38.mp3"},{"answer":"it enhances the image of the company straight away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/39.mp3"},{"answer":"So in the long run it should help them to attract clients, and improve their sales figures?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/40.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the idea. Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, all in all it sounds very positive -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I will go ahead and apply for a placement myself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/43.mp3"},{"answer":"How do I go about it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/44.mp3"},{"answer":"It's easy enough to do,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/45.mp3"},{"answer":"because there's a government agency called STEP","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/46.mp3"},{"answer":"S-T-E-P","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/47.mp3"},{"answer":"- that organises placements for students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/48.mp3"},{"answer":"You should start by getting their booklet with all the details -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I expect you can download one from their website.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, they've got copies in the psychology department -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I've seen them there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/52.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll just go to the office and pick one up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/54.mp3"},{"answer":"And then if I were you, after I'd looked at it I'd go over all the options with someone...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose I should ask my tutor's advice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/56.mp3"},{"answer":"He knows more about me than anyone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/57.mp3"},{"answer":"One of the career officers would be better,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/58.mp3"},{"answer":"they've got more knowledge about the jobs market than your personal tutor would have.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/59.mp3"},{"answer":"OK...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/60.mp3"},{"answer":"And then when you know what you want you can register with STEP -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/61.mp3"},{"answer":"you'll find their address in the booklet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/62.mp3"},{"answer":"And once you've registered they assign you to a mentor who looks after your application.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/63.mp3"},{"answer":"And then I suppose you just sit back and wait till you hear something?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/64.mp3"},{"answer":"They told me at the careers office that it's best to be proactive, and get updates yourself","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/65.mp3"},{"answer":"by checking the website for new placement alerts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Your mentor is supposed to keep you informed, but you can't rely on that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/67.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't suppose it's a good idea to get in touch with companies directly, is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Not really...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/69.mp3"},{"answer":"But it is the company who notifies you if they want you to go for an interview.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/70.mp3"},{"answer":"You get a letter of invitation or an email from personnel departments.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/71.mp3"},{"answer":"And do I reply directly to them?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/73.mp3"},{"answer":"STEP only gets involved again once you've been made a job offer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Right...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/75.mp3"},{"answer":"So, once you've had an interview you should let your mentor know what the outcome is?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/76.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean whether you're offered a job, and whether you've decided to accept it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/77.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/78.mp3"},{"answer":"They'll inform the careers office once a placement has been agreed,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/79.mp3"},{"answer":"so you don't have to do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that all then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/81.mp3"},{"answer":"More or less.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Only once you've accepted an offer you'll probably have to supply a reference,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/83.mp3"},{"answer":"because the placement will be conditional on that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/84.mp3"},{"answer":"And that's something you should ask your own tutor to provide.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/85.mp3"},{"answer":"He knows about your academic ability and also about your qualities, like reliability.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, thanks very much for the information -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/87.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm starting to look...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-4-part-3-2023-06-16-15-49-02/88.mp3"}]
